        <mxCell id="i26__2" value="The enclosing frame is the top module; the two blocks are its instances. The synchronizer instances u_sync_req and u_sync_ack are inside u_dst and u_src respectively. The request toggle and the bundled payload cross from u_src to u_dst on the drawn REQ connector. The acknowledge toggle and the bundled return payload cross back from u_dst to u_src and are listed in the DACK row of the interface table, because the forward and return crossings share one block boundary. Both cross-domain control signals are one-bit toggles through m_vlsit_afifo_cell_sync; both payloads are held for the whole handshake." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fontSize=18;fontColor=#000000;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1" vlsit_library_sha256="D1631ACF98A920526B235E8970FEDDC9305EA2F0D6A35C6529CD220D62AFABB6" vlsit_library_entry="0" vlsit_library_cell="2" vlsit_library_instance="i26">
